]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"91bad7e9096c3b8f\" href=\"?note=91bad7e9096c3b8f\" title=\"43-df-jump-traceable\">43-df-jump-traceable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{JumpTraceable}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KTrivial}(A)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{JumpTraceable}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补足书中强于单纯低性的结果；迹控制的是实际对角计算值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"91bad7e9096c3b8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump-traceable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-jump-traceable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump-traceable","status":"resolved","id":"91bad7e9096c3b8f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-jump-traceable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","d